| OQ-SEQ-003 | Has an experienced GC, remodeling PM, or equivalent expert validated the dependency rules and critical-path flags? | Technical Specification V2 and the Static Data Source Register treat dependency rules as a build blocker before sequencer coding. | Product owner / construction reviewer | Sequencer coding | Open |
| OQ-SEQ-004 | Should accessibility subtypes also have separate DOM-impact rows, or should DOM impact inherit from the parent accessibility category while duration/lead-time differs by subtype? | Splitting duration taxonomy may create mismatch unless recommendation catalog, DOM impact, and sequencing taxonomy are aligned. | Product owner / product architect | Recommendation catalog finalization | Open |
